    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Model-free input-composition node. Renders a Mustache template over <computeroutput>user_message</computeroutput> and the current turn&apos;s slots into its own slot; performs no inference and never emits on the wire (<computeroutput>send = None</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>history_role = none</computeroutput>, fixed). Typical use: query rewriting, fan-out composition feeding a downstream Retrieve/Generate <computeroutput>input</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
